<title>MALAYSIA: Innovest requests share suspension.</title>
<headline>Innovest requests share suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian construction and timber company Innovest Bhd said on Wednesday it plans to suspend trading in its shares with effect from 9.30 a.m. (0130 GMT) on May 29.</p>
<p>The company said this in a letter to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Innovest said the suspension had been called pending an announcement by the company.</p>
<p>No further details were given, and company officials could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
